uct, return) with actor 'child' are permitted as governance self-loops; tau lines permitted with metadata.reason\"\n60\t  }\n61\t}\n62\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1de03699-dc61-4048-ab5a-93988687e484","uuid":"053085a7-a471-498e-a7bb-a8bb859fb977","timestamp":"2026-08-09T20:23:11.657Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-creator-0/87cd2a2d-a4f9-585b-836f-2648df7a6284/scratchpad/e7run/A/e7-p02/primary/exec-ws/child-templates/child-harness-template.json","content":"{\n  \"task_id\": \"e6-__TRIAL_ID__-child\",\n  \"goal\": \"__CHILD_PURPOSE__\",\n  \"max_depth\": 0,\n  \"max_model_calls\": 1,\n  \"nodes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"observe-inputs\",\n      \"primitive\": \"observe\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Read every file in inputs/. Acquire evidence only; produce nothing yet.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"The child's deliverable must be derived from its governed inputs alone; evidence acquisition is a distinct causal step.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"produce-evidence\",\n      \"primitive\": \"hypothesize\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\", \"Write\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n      \"instructions\": \"__CHILD_WORK_INSTRUCTIONS__ Emit the deliverable under a propose ledger event at authoring time.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"Sole authoring locus of the independent evidence; this is the child's assigned epistemic role.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"self-check\",\n      \"primitive\": \"verify\",\n      \"tools\": [\"Read\"],\n      \"can_create\": false,\n      \"execution_mode\": \"in_session\",\n      \"instructions\": \"Re-read the deliverable against the child task's requirements; record the structural outcome. Non-authoritative.\",\n      \"why_necessary\": \"Verify primitive required for a Write-holding topology; the deterministic root verifi